      "value": "I get absolutely plastered with in-app stuff to get VRC+, and I'm not going to pay one red cent for this unless native Linux support is finally treated seriously as a whole, from the app itself to VCC+Unity.  If it's shaders calling platform-specific stuff, you have the ability to require platform-agnostic support.\n\nThis all has been a complaint since the beginning and while I appreciate the small work that has been done in places, it really does need to be a co-priority with Windows+Android support.",
